option.UNDERWATER_COLOR_G=Underwater Green
option.UNDERWATER_COLOR_B=Underwater Blue
option.TAA=Temporal Anti-Aliasing
option.TAA.comment=Smooths jagged edges and noise by blending several frames. Also steadies water reflections and stars.
option.TAA_SMOOTHING=TAA Smoothing
option.TAA_SMOOTHING.comment=How much of the previous frames is kept. Higher is smoother but can blur in motion.
option.TAA_JITTER=TAA Jitter
option.TAA_JITTER.comment=Sub-pixel camera shake that lets TAA anti-alias edges. 0 keeps TAA's noise smoothing without edge anti-aliasing.
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING=Image Sharpening
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING.comment=Restores detail softened by TAA (contrast-adaptive, so edges do not ring).
value.IMAGE_SHARPENING.0=Off
option.OPAQUE_BLOCKS_CAUSTICS=Opaque Blocks Stop Caustics
option.OPAQUE_BLOCKS_CAUSTICS.comment=Translucent blocks more opaque than the limit (tinted glass, dense stained glass, ...) cast no caustics on the water under them. Their coloured light still gets through.
option.CAUSTICS_OPACITY_LIMIT=Caustics Opacity Limit
option.CAUSTICS_OPACITY_LIMIT.comment=How opaque a translucent block must be to stop caustics (with Opaque Blocks Stop Caustics on). Clear glass is about 0.3.
screen.CLOUDS=Clouds & Light Shafts
screen.CLOUDS.comment=Volumetric clouds, their shadows, and sun rays through the air.
