option.BLOCK_REFLECTIONS=§eBlock Reflections§r
option.BLOCK_REFLECTIONS.comment=Polished stone, metals, gems, glazed terracotta and the like. Highlights: only the sun and moon shine on them. Full: they also reflect the world and the sky.
